## Third-party components and their repositories

P.R.I.S.M.'s own code, configuration, documentation and model-derived artifacts
are **not** licensed under MIT (nor under any other open-source license) — they
are All Rights Reserved as stated above. No third-party license — including MIT —
is granted to, or extends to, P.R.I.S.M.'s own code.

The following third-party repositories remain under their own respective
licenses, attributed here and (where applicable) via NOTICE files in
`model_assets/libreyolo/` and provenance records in
`docs/licenses_and_provenance.md`. Their terms stay in force on their own
components only.

| Repository | Used as | License in that repository |
| --- | --- | --- |
| OpenCV (`opencv-python`) — <https://github.com/opencv/opencv> | decode, ORB tracking, DNN ONNX runtime, display | Apache-2.0 |
| PyTorch — <https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch> · TorchVision — <https://github.com/pytorch/vision> | inference, training, backbones | BSD-3-Clause |
| NumPy — <https://github.com/numpy/numpy> · SciPy — <https://github.com/scipy/scipy> | numerics, optimisation | BSD-3-Clause |
| Transformers — <https://github.com/huggingface/transformers> · huggingface_hub — <https://github.com/huggingface/huggingface_hub> | local-only weight loading; downloads | Apache-2.0 |
| ONNX Runtime — <https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime> | inference | MIT |
| Open3D — <https://github.com/isl-org/Open3D> | optional viewer | MIT |
| Norfair — <https://github.com/tryolabs/norfair> | optional tracker | BSD-3-Clause |
| Stable-Baselines3 — <https://github.com/DLR-RM/stable-baselines3> | historic PPO training | MIT |
| GTSAM (optional) — <https://github.com/borglab/gtsam> | optional pose-graph backend | BSD-3-Clause |
| LibreYOLO — <https://github.com/LibreYOLO/libreyolo> · LibreYOLO9t checkpoint — <https://huggingface.co/LibreYOLO/LibreYOLO9t> | 2-D detection evidence; SHA-pinned checkpoint; notices in `model_assets/libreyolo/` | MIT (implementation and model card) |
| YOLOP — <https://github.com/hustvl/YOLOP> | optional provider; local SHA-pinned ONNX only, never vendored; weight terms UNVERIFIED | MIT (repo license file); weights not cleared for redistribution |
| COLMAP — <https://github.com/colmap/colmap> | local read-only sparse probe (4.2.1 CPU binary stays external) | BSD-3-Clause upsteam; bundled LSD component AGPL-3.0 — binary NOT redistributed |
| Depth Anything V2-Small (HF: `depth-anything/Depth-Anything-V2-Small-hf`) | relative depth; local-only weights | Apache-2.0 (model card) |
| SegFormer B0 ADE20K (HF: `nvidia/segformer-b0-finetuned-ade-512-512`) · NVIDIA SegFormer — <https://github.com/NVlabs/SegFormer> | terrain teacher; local-only | NVIDIA Source Code License (non-commercial); terms recorded at link level |
| TUM RGB-D benchmark — <https://vision.in.tum.de/data/datasets/rgbd-dataset> | validation trajectories (freiburg1_xyz / rpy / 360) | CC-BY-4.0 (data) · BSD-2-Clause (accompanying code); not redistributed |
| grid_map — <https://github.com/ANYbotics/grid_map> · elevation_mapping — <https://github.com/leggedrobotics/elevation_mapping> · traversability_estimation — <https://github.com/leggedrobotics/traversability_estimation> | concept reuse only; no source copied | BSD-3-Clause |
| Basalt — <https://github.com/VladyslavUsenko/basalt> · RTAB-Map — <https://github.com/introlab/rtabmap> · stella_vslam — <https://github.com/stella-cv/stella_vslam> | evaluated integration candidates, not downloaded | BSD-3-Clause / BSD-2-Clause |
| ROS 2 — <https://github.com/ros2> (Jazzy) · Gazebo — <https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim> (Harmonic) | optional deployment targets | Apache-2.0 |
| Gymnasium — <https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Gymnasium> | historic RL environment | MIT |

